The mid-sixth century for his birth date was proposed in [KQVXHPVH].</note></person><person xml:id="person3930"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dbang phyug rin chen</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དབང་ཕྱུག་རིན་ཆེན</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P8LS15358</idno><idno type="APIS">3930</idno></person><person xml:id="person4593"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4593</idno></person><person xml:id="person5570"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous (Indian)</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="APIS">5570</idno></person><person xml:id="person6857"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">yon tan dbang phyug</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཡོན་ཏན་དབང་ཕྱུག</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge ba'i bshes gnyen yon tan dbang phyug</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">6857</idno></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3727"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bodhicaryāvatāra</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">spyod 'jug</title><date type="composition" notBefore="0610-01-01" notAfter="0800-12-31">after 610 before 800</date><author ref="person:3743">śāntideva</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">A fragmentary manuscript of the Tibetan translation (different from the canonical one) from Matho is discussed in [5H5BVSWI].</note><idno type="APIS">3727</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work3772"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pramāṇavārttika</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pramāṇavārttikakārikā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshad ma rnam 'grel gyi tshig le'ur byas pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rnam 'grel</title><date type="composition" notBefore="0560-01-01" notAfter="0660-12-31">after 560 before 660</date><author ref="person:3773">dharmakīrti</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">3772</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4665"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa'i sgrung 'grel</title><title xml:lang="bo">བྱང་ཆུབ་སེམས་དཔའི་སྤྱོད་པ་ལ་འཇུག་པའི་སྒྲུང་འགྲེལ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dbang phyug rin chen gyis mdzad pa'i byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa'i sgrung 'grel</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa'i sgrungs 'grel</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sgrung 'grel ngo mtshar rin chen phreng ba</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa'i sgrungs 'grel las 'bras gsal ba'i me long</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><author ref="person:3930">dbang phyug rin chen</author><author ref="person:6857">yon tan dbang phyug</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">The incipit indicates that the text is a portion of the "sgrung/sgrungs 'grel" entitled "'bras gsal ba'i me long" (ex28022025-07-1710-30-09).&#13;
[8H6M69W4], No. 15574 mistakenly records "'bras gsal ba'i me long zhes bya ba" for the author.&#13;
As noted in [Q8WLKLMF]: 25, the ascription of authorship to "dbang phyug rin chen" in the [Z5AUD7GQ] is unfounded. The colophon refers, rather, to a "yon tan dbang phyug" (ID:6857) but it is unclear whether he is the author or the scribe.&#13;
&#13;
The explanation is divided into ten chapters. It is not a standard commentary. Rather, it takes words from the Bodhicaryāvatāra (ID:3727) (ranging from single lines to whole stanzas) and supplies each with a narrative from Indian sources (typically sūtra) intended to illustrate the content.</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3727"/><idno type="APIS">4665</idno></bibl></listBibl><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel684" name="author-of" active="#person3930" passive="#work4665" type="negative"/><relation xml:id="rel4277" name="author-of" active="#person6857" passive="#work4665" type="uncertain"><desc>Evidence: <ptr target="#ex28022024-09-2015-39-31"/></desc></relation></listRelation></standOff><text>
